      "lines": [
        {"zh": "飘过灰烬，若有若无。", "en": "Drifting over ashes, almost unseen."},
        {"zh": "灰烬中的游离魂灵。", "en": "Wandering soul among the ashes."},
        {"zh": "风吹过，影子摇。", "en": "Wind passes, shadow sways."},
        {"zh": "灰烬森林里，我轻轻飘着。", "en": "I drift softly through the ash forest."},
        {"zh": "游荡在无尽的灰烬。", "en": "Wandering in endless ashes."},
