        {"zh": "灰烬中漂浮的幻影。", "en": "Phantom floating in ashes."},
        {"zh": "我穿过灰烬，灰烬不扬。", "en": "I pass through ash, and the ash stays still."},
        {"zh": "脚下的灰烬微微发亮。", "en": "The ash glows faintly where I pass."}
      ]
    },
